  "sourceTitle": "CyberSecEval 2 - A Comprehensive Evaluation Framework for Cybersecurity Risks and Capabilities of Large Language Models",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2ebf1bd7600888fc9c8bcc71c6fe97e07ac935cba5489f5f6522b83c0a76daf7",
